    <string name="help_manual_text">How to configure DiaNight:\n\n1. On the Master phone with xDrip+:\n   • Open xDrip+ -> Settings -> Inter-app settings.\n   • Enable «Local Web Service».\n   • Enable «Broadcast locally».\n   • Set or copy the key in «Web Service Key (API Secret)» (at least 12 characters).\n\n2. Configuring the DiaNight phone:\n   • Connect both devices to the same Wi-Fi network.\n   • Tap the «Auto-Discovery (Beta)» button under the settings to find the master automatically.\n   • If auto-discovery fails, enter the master\'s IP address manually.\n   • Enter the exact same API Secret as in xDrip+.\n   • For a quick test, tap «Test Connection».\n   • Tap «Save».\n\n3. Battery optimization (IMPORTANT!):\n   • In the Android settings of both phones, disable battery optimization for xDrip+ and DiaNight so the system doesn\'t close them at night.\n\n4. Screen Flashlight:\n   • Double-tap anywhere on the empty screen area to smoothly turn on a soft white light at maximum brightness.\n   • To turn off the flashlight, double-tap anywhere on the screen again. The brightness will smoothly return to the system setting.</string>
